SRR4032347	PRJNA338980	SRP082167	SAMN05578234	SRX2023804	Mus musculus	Unsorted-plusDox-rep2	Unsorted-plusDox-rep2	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2279984: Unsorted-plusDox-rep2 Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	RNA was extracted using TRIzol and purified using the Direct-zol RNA MiniPrep Kit by Zymo Research Intact poly(A) RNA was purified from total RNA samples (100-500 ng) with oligo(dT) magnetic beads and stranded mRNA sequencing libraries were prepared as described using the Illumina TruSeq Stranded mRNA Library Preparation Kit (RS-122-2101, RS-122-2102). Purified libraries were qualified on an Agilent Technologies 2200 TapeStation using a D1000 ScreenTape assay (cat# 5067-5582 and 5067-5583). The molarity of adapter-modified molecules was defined by quantitative PCR using the Kapa Biosystems Kapa Library Quant Kit (cat#KK4824). Individual libraries were normalized to 10 nM and equal volumes were pooled in preparation for Illumina sequence analysis. Sequencing libraries (25 pM) were chemically denatured and applied to an Illumina HiSeq v4 single- or paired-end flow cell using an Illumina cBot. Hybridized molecules were clonally amplified and annealed to sequencing primers with reagents from an Illumina HiSeq SR Cluster Kit v4-cBot (GD-401-4001) or PE Cluster Kit v4-cBot (PE-401-4001). Following transfer of the flowcell to an Illumina HiSeq 2500 instrument (HCS v2.2.38 and RTA v1.18.61), a 50 cycle single-read or a 125 cycle paired-end sequence run was performed using HiSeq SBS Kit v4 sequencing reagents (FC-401-4003).	34500889	8625222250	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR403/007/SRR4032347/SRR4032347_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR403/007/SRR4032347/SRR4032347_2.fastq.gz	665c1b618e887046b58d36a59ff97eea;cffab04c2329465e229e6b5b0d4b4af6	2737881253;2838008499
